@startuml
|Secretary|
start
:Receive donation;
:Select contribution type;
:Record amount, currency & received date;
:Record payment method & reference;
if (Target?) then (Specific student)
  :Link to sponsor & student;
else (General)
  :Leave as general donation;
endif

|Program Coordinator|
:Select payout type\n(Subsidy / Pocket Money / Stipend);
:Enter local_amount in BDT;
:Look up monthly exchange rate\nfrom exchange_rates table;
if (Rate found?) then (Yes)
  :Calculate USD equivalent\n(= local_amount / rate);
else (No)
  :Show error:\nRate unavailable — contact IT;
  stop
endif
:Record payout date & notes;
if (Disburse now?) then (Yes)
  :Hand over BDT to student;
  :Set status to Paid;
else (No)
  :Set status to Pending;
endif

|System|
:Log to audit trail;
:Update contribution balance;
stop
@enduml
